This project utilizes open-source machine learning models, libraries, and fonts.
Their respective licenses and attributions are detailed below:

1. Helsinki-NLP Opus-MT Translation Models
   - Creators: Jörg Tiedemann, Santhosh Thottingal, University of Helsinki Language Technology Research Group
   - License: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC-BY-4.0)
   - License URL: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
