     Vitaliy Liptchinsky, Sergey Edunov, Edouard Grave, Michael Auli, Armand Joulin (Meta AI / FAIR)
   - License: MIT License (Meta Platforms, Inc.)
   - Citation:
     Angela Fan et al. 2020. Beyond English-Centric Multilingual Machine Translation.
   - ONNX Port: Converted to browser-ready ONNX Q8 format by Xenova (Transformers.js).

